       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LINTRIAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PAGED ASSIGN TO "PAGED".
           SELECT VARIED ASSIGN TO "VARIED".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PAGED LINAGE 5 WITH FOOTING 4 LINES AT TOP 1
           LINES AT BOTTOM 1.
       01  PREC PIC X(4).
       FD  VARIED LINAGE LN.
       01  VREC PIC X(4).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  LN PIC 9 VALUE 5.
       01  E PIC Z9.
       01  K PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN OUTPUT PAGED
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "1 " E
           MOVE "L2" TO PREC WRITE PREC
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "2 " E
           MOVE "L3" TO PREC WRITE PREC BEFORE 1
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "3 " E
           MOVE "L4" TO PREC WRITE PREC AFTER 1
               AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY "4 EOP" END-WRITE
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "4 " E
           MOVE "L5" TO PREC WRITE PREC AFTER 2
               AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY "5 EOP" END-WRITE
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "5 " E
           MOVE "L6" TO PREC WRITE PREC AFTER PAGE
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "6 " E
           MOVE "L7" TO PREC WRITE PREC BEFORE 3
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "7 " E
           MOVE "L8" TO PREC WRITE PREC BEFORE 2
           MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF PAGED TO E DISPLAY "8 " E
           CLOSE PAGED
           OPEN OUTPUT VARIED
           MOVE 2 TO LN
           PERFORM 8 TIMES
               ADD 1 TO K
               MOVE "V" TO VREC WRITE VREC
               MOVE LINAGE-COUNTER OF VARIED TO E DISPLAY "V" K " " E
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE VARIED
           STOP RUN.
